  "description_short": "Country-style restaurant in Great Brak River serving hearty meals with a relaxed, family-friendly atmosphere.",
  "description_long": "Peperboom Restaurant sits on Lang Street in the quiet riverside suburb of Bergsig, offering a welcome break from the coast with its country-kitchen charm. The menu leans toward generous South African favourites and comfort food, with portions that won't leave you hungry and prices that keep locals coming back.\n\nThe relaxed setting works well for families and casual lunches, with a garden area that appeals to those looking for something unhurried. It's the kind of place where you can settle in without fuss, order something satisfying, and enjoy the slower pace of Great Brak River. The straightforward approach and consistent quality have earned it a loyal following among residents and passing travellers alike.",
